":"Macin","author":"macin","category":"商业与行业观察","description":"博主 macin 主理的独立博客，归入【商业与行业观察】，主要聚焦 分享、投资、学习 等主题的持续记录与实践探索。","subcategory":"投资与金融","status":"summary_only","last_checked":"2026-11-28T17:02:56+00:00","last_success":"2026-11-28T17:02:56+00:00","original_tags":"分享、投资、学习、Crypto、日常、阅读、人文","homepage_url":"https://macin.org/","keywords":["分享","投资","学习","Crypto","日常","阅读","人文"],"articles":[{"id":71282,"source_id":"qiaomu-0827","source_name":"Macin","category":"商业与行业观察","source_order":34,"published_at":"2026-11-23T20:14:48+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-26T08:05:13+00:00","first_seen_at":"2026-11-25T18:44:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T17:02:56+00:00","revision":2,"current_revision":2,"backfill":false,"content_kind":"summary","change_kind":"revised","change_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","change_label":"当日修订","revised_today":true,"revised_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","observed_revision":2,"publication_date_status":"known","snapshot_available":true,"content_observed_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","title":"桃垭村：北碚赏秋僻静地","summary":"阅读全文 → 小雪是什么感觉呢？对南方人来说，就是一个深秋。本是习以为常的悲凉，偏偏这个周末，恍恍惚惚里掺进了一缕阳光。于是人人都欢欣鼓舞地走出门去，去拥抱大自然慷慨的馈赠。 改了半日论文，中午去吃福建菜，又重新爱上了福建菜。前不久在巴山附近吃过一家福建小吃，闽南咸饭是油润的，牛排像在泉州吃到的那样，脱骨的肋排，牛肉羹汤有浓郁的中药味，黑乎乎的汤头估计要吓到小朋友。老板菜单上写的是金线鱼，大家都说是黄鱼——二十元一份，还要什么自行车呢？请小伙伴发消息问他在泉州的大学同学，正宗否，答曰，看起来还行。","url":"https://macin.org/2026/11/23/bei-pei-tao-wu-cun/","public_excerpt":true},{"id":71028,"source_id":"qiaomu-0827","source_name":"Macin","category":"商业与行业观察","source_order":34,"published_at":"2026-10-23T21:22:47+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-26T08:05:13+00:00","first_seen_at":"2026-11-22T16:30:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T17:02:56+00:00","revision":3,"current_revision":3,"backfill":true,"content_kind":"summary","change_kind":"revised","change_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","change_label":"当日修订","revised_today":true,"revised_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","observed_revision":3,"publication_date_status":"known","snapshot_available":true,"content_observed_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","title":"曼龙勒雨林赶摆，尝尝竹筒酸腌鱼","summary":"阅读全文 → 逛菜市场是筷子小手多年不改的癖好。 大大小小的菜市场见得不算少，昆明那趟印象尤深，青头菌、见手青摆得满地都是，颜色扎眼。 可傣族的菜市场，倒还是头一遭见。市场如何倒在其次，雨林深处烟熏火燎里那一道道丁达尔光柱，才是真正教人心动的地方——光从棕榈树的缝隙里斜斜地漏下来，摊子上的水汽、烤肉的烟气，全被那光柱一寸寸地照亮，整条街都像在佛龛里。","url":"https://macin.org/2026/10/23/man-long-le-gan-bai/","public_excerpt":true},{"id":71027,"source_id":"qiaomu-0827","source_name":"Macin","category":"商业与行业观察","source_order":34,"published_at":"2026-10-28T14:53:51+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-26T08:05:13+00:00","first_seen_at":"2026-11-22T16:30:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T17:02:56+00:00","revision":3,"current_revision":3,"backfill":true,"content_kind":"summary","change_kind":"revised","change_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","change_label":"当日修订","revised_today":true,"revised_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","observed_revision":3,"publication_date_status":"known","snapshot_available":true,"content_observed_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","title":"云南盐津：真一线城市","summary":"阅读全文 → 从云南回重庆，车过北闸就开始钻洞。 北闸隧道二十四公里，出来是上高桥，打堡寨两号、一号，王家坪，小垭口，堰沟，赵家屋，银盘，大树子，胡家湾子二号、一号，老营盘八公里，小岩脚，凉水井，唐家营，四方石——二十九公里。 这一串名字念下来，像有人在报一串很长的贯口。豆沙关在县城西南二十二公里，进入县城之前会路过。豆沙关的本名叫石门关。","url":"https://macin.org/2026/10/28/yun-nan-yan-jin/","public_excerpt":true},{"id":71026,"source_id":"qiaomu-0827","source_name":"Macin","category":"商业与行业观察","source_order":34,"published_at":"2026-11-05T21:19:55+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-26T08:05:13+00:00","first_seen_at":"2026-11-22T16:30:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T17:02:56+00:00","revision":3,"current_revision":3,"backfill":true,"content_kind":"summary","change_kind":"revised","change_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","change_label":"当日修订","revised_today":true,"revised_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","observed_revision":3,"publication_date_status":"known","snapshot_available":true,"content_observed_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","title":"建水夜行：翻开聊斋的那一夜","summary":"阅读全文 → 团山古民居 中午到的建水，日头正烈，先驱车去团山村看张家花园。张家花园建于清光绪三十二年，是团山张氏在个旧开锡矿发了财回乡建的宅子。 进门是花园祠堂，五开间，卷棚屋顶，雕梁画栋。两侧有两层小楼，廊沿上置着美人靠——那种带弧形靠背的木质长椅，凭栏临水，是乘凉发呆的地方。","url":"https://macin.org/2026/11/05/yun-nan-jian-shui/","public_excerpt":true},{"id":71025,"source_id":"qiaomu-0827","source_name":"Macin","category":"商业与行业观察","source_order":34,"published_at":"2026-11-10T15:53:04+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-26T08:05:13+00:00","first_seen_at":"2026-11-22T16:30:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T17:02:56+00:00","revision":3,"current_revision":3,"backfill":true,"content_kind":"summary","change_kind":"revised","change_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","change_label":"当日修订","revised_today":true,"revised_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","observed_revision":3,"publication_date_status":"known","snapshot_available":true,"content_observed_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","title":"云南弥勒的三种水","summary":"阅读全文 → 弥勒有三种水。地下暗河的水，天上落下的水，以及从地心涌出的水。 白龙洞 先去了白龙洞，去看第一种水。 弥勒虹溪镇，白龙洞的洞口高十米、宽十米，像一条白龙张大了嘴。1989年开发，赵朴初题字，世界洞穴协会考察过。门票便宜，老人20，全票30。这种票价在今天的景区已经很少见了。","url":"https://macin.org/2026/11/10/yun-nan-mi-le/","public_excerpt":true},{"id":71024,"source_id":"qiaomu-0827","source_name":"Macin","category":"商业与行业观察","source_order":34,"published_at":"2026-11-17T20:37:51+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-26T08:05:13+00:00","first_seen_at":"2026-11-22T16:30:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T17:02:56+00:00","revision":3,"current_revision":3,"backfill":true,"content_kind":"summary","change_kind":"revised","change_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","change_label":"当日修订","revised_today":true,"revised_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","observed_revision":3,"publication_date_status":"known","snapshot_available":true,"content_observed_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","title":"蒙自与个旧：米线的烫，联大的远，锡都的慢","summary":"阅读全文 → 过桥米线 中午到的蒙自，日头正烈。我在南湖边上的一家大酒店吃过桥米线。 蒙自是过桥米线的发源地，服务员端来托盘，碗里的高汤浮着一层鸡油，还滚烫着。配菜摆了一小桌：火腿片切得薄，鹌鹑蛋盛在小碟里。要自己一样样往汤里下，生的推下去，在热汤里变了颜色，变了质地。","url":"https://macin.org/2026/11/17/yun-nan-meng-zi/","public_excerpt":true},{"id":41354,"source_id":"qiaomu-0827","source_name":"Macin","category":"商业与行业观察","source_order":34,"published_at":"2026-09-30T12:01:20+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-26T08:05:13+00:00","first_seen_at":"2026-10-19T21:11:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T17:02:56+00:00","revision":4,"current_revision":4,"backfill":true,"content_kind":"summary","change_kind":"revised","change_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","change_label":"当日修订","revised_today":true,"revised_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","observed_revision":4,"publication_date_status":"known","snapshot_available":true,"content_observed_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","title":"2026秋：吹尽狂沙始到金","summary":"阅读全文 → 7月 出发古城西安，看一家做图像传输业务的企业。又能学到什么行业冷知识呢？哈哈哈 明天去首都北京，看一家做机器人零部件的企业。同样是CNC零部件加工，在机器人这个领域可能还有45%左右的毛利率，但是在汽车零部件领域利润就非常薄了，加上主机厂的账期压榨，基本是卷死掉。所以，这家企业即使手握订单，也很难做这个投资决定。 “刺激消费”到底是一个什么问题？产能过剩的原因是消费不足，还是市场化机制失灵？原来历史课本里讲牛奶倒进河里也不分给穷人，那是资本主义的弊端，现在产能过剩是不是与此类似？ 看完《庆余年》，曾经很火热的电视剧。豆瓣用户对此一句评论画龙点睛：“范闲的理想主义需要六个顶配大爹才能保住狗命。所以你看见理想的门槛了吗？” 看了一部96年的老电视剧《无悔追踪》，豆瓣评分9.4分！说是抓特务，其实是一部新中国的编年史。比现在的开水白菜电视剧好看多了。 用 WorkBuddy 把这个小破站优化了一下： 项目 优化前 优化后（线上实测） robots.txt 404 200 ✅ sitemap.xml 404 200（414 URL）✅ baidusitemap.xml 不存在 200 ✅ 结构化数据 JSON-LD 0 处 文章页 330 个含 BlogPosting+BreadcrumbList ✅ canonical 无 全站 647 页 ✅ preconnect 0 ","url":"https://macin.org/2026/09/30/202607/","public_excerpt":true},{"id":41353,"source_id":"qiaomu-0827","source_name":"Macin","category":"商业与行业观察","source_order":34,"published_at":"2026-10-06T18:47:28+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-26T08:05:13+00:00","first_seen_at":"2026-10-19T21:11:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T17:02:56+00:00","revision":4,"current_revision":4,"backfill":true,"content_kind":"summary","change_kind":"revised","change_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","change_label":"当日修订","revised_today":true,"revised_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","observed_revision":4,"publication_date_status":"known","snapshot_available":true,"content_observed_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","title":"孟连娜允：牛油果刺身配傣族最后一座古城","summary":"阅读全文 → 孟连这地方，原不在计划之内。 若不是这趟专程走滇南，这辈子大概都不知道“孟连”两个字。 可到了才知道，云南的小城，都各有各的风味——路边随便支张桌子，坐下的人便能从日头正当中喝到夕阳西下，风里飘的都是些不着急的味道，一盏酒能喝出半日的功夫来。","url":"https://macin.org/2026/10/06/meng-lian-nuo-yun/","public_excerpt":true},{"id":41352,"source_id":"qiaomu-0827","source_name":"Macin","category":"商业与行业观察","source_order":34,"published_at":"2026-10-13T15:16:39+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-26T08:05:13+00:00","first_seen_at":"2026-10-19T21:11:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T17:02:56+00:00","revision":4,"current_revision":4,"backfill":true,"content_kind":"summary","change_kind":"revised","change_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","change_label":"当日修订","revised_today":true,"revised_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","observed_revision":4,"publication_date_status":"known","snapshot_available":true,"content_observed_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","title":"避开人潮的秘诀？西双版纳勐远仙境，整片雨林都是你的","summary":"阅读全文 → 西双版纳勐腊县有个勐远仙境，藏在热带雨林国家公园深处。 你以为出行是可以特意躲开节假日，出发前查了半天日历，把周末、小长假、连着的调休全部避开，专挑一个再普通不过的工作日。实际上所有的出行都是临时起意，这对于J人真是一种痛苦。 不过所谓“撞运气”，到了景区门口，停车场空空荡荡，就知道来的好。","url":"https://macin.org/2026/10/13/meng-yuan-yu-lin/","public_excerpt":true},{"id":34223,"source_id":"qiaomu-0827","source_name":"Macin","category":"商业与行业观察","source_order":34,"published_at":"2026-09-29T19:00:10+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-26T08:05:13+00:00","first_seen_at":"2026-09-30T06:52:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T17:02:56+00:00","revision":5,"current_revision":5,"backfill":false,"content_kind":"summary","change_kind":"revised","change_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","change_label":"当日修订","revised_today":true,"revised_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","observed_revision":5,"publication_date_status":"known","snapshot_available":true,"content_observed_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","title":"西盟：龙摩爷满是牛头骨，和一个消失了七十年的风俗","summary":"阅读全文 → 这一路的遗憾，最后都并成了一个数字：九公里。 左都村离我们只差这么点路，却终究没能去成。要不是为了它，我们压根不会去租那辆费油的“大狗”，专挑一辆吃力气的车，就是笃定了左都的路不好走。","url":"https://macin.org/2026/09/29/meng-suo-long-tan/","public_excerpt":true},{"id":33457,"source_id":"qiaomu-0827","source_name":"Macin","category":"商业与行业观察","source_order":34,"published_at":"2026-09-22T18:27:23+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-26T08:05:13+00:00","first_seen_at":"2026-09-22T16:21:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T17:02:56+00:00","revision":7,"current_revision":7,"backfill":false,"content_kind":"summary","change_kind":"revised","change_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","change_label":"当日修订","revised_today":true,"revised_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","observed_revision":7,"publication_date_status":"known","snapshot_available":true,"content_observed_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","title":"普洱采茶：杀青烫手，和我那杯叫不响的永川秀芽","summary":"阅读全文 → 上一篇在普洱的山里采了三筐菌子，敢下锅的没几样；这一篇，还是普洱，蹲进茶垄里，炒了一锅自己都怕的烈茶。 我的家乡也产茶，但都是些上不了台面的口粮茶，譬如永川秀芽，泡开来是极清淡的一种绿，喝的人自己知道好，外人却叫不出名字。不比杭州的龙井、福建的大红袍，一提起来便有典故跟着。 所以在我心里，普洱这两个字，从小就和茶焊在了一起——普洱，普洱茶，仿佛这地方生来就是为了长茶叶的。","url":"https://macin.org/2026/09/22/pu-er-cai-cha/","public_excerpt":true},{"id":32409,"source_id":"qiaomu-0827","source_name":"Macin","category":"商业与行业观察","source_order":34,"published_at":"2026-09-14T09:52:54+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-26T08:05:13+00:00","first_seen_at":"2026-09-15T17:22:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T17:02:56+00:00","revision":8,"current_revision":8,"backfill":false,"content_kind":"summary","change_kind":"revised","change_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","change_label":"当日修订","revised_today":true,"revised_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","observed_revision":8,"publication_date_status":"known","snapshot_available":true,"content_observed_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","title":"普洱采菌：三筐菌子，敢下锅的没几样","summary":"阅读全文 → 上一篇还在西双版纳——曼丢古寺的贝叶经、勐仑植物园的龙脑香小苗都看过了；这一篇，车已经开进了普洱的山里。 不为别的事，就为几筐菌子。 采了满满三筐，真敢下锅的没几样；最金贵的鸡枞，和能致命的鹅膏菌，只差一个平顶。","url":"https://macin.org/2026/09/14/pu-er-cai-jun-zi/","public_excerpt":true},{"id":291,"source_id":"qiaomu-0827","source_name":"Macin","category":"商业与行业观察","source_order":34,"published_at":"2026-07-13T15:17:26+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-26T08:05:13+00:00","first_seen_at":"2026-09-09T18:41:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T17:02:56+00:00","revision":9,"current_revision":9,"backfill":true,"content_kind":"summary","change_kind":"revised","change_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","change_label":"当日修订","revised_today":true,"revised_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","observed_revision":9,"publication_date_status":"known","snapshot_available":true,"content_observed_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","title":"尖山子石刻：比大足石刻还早300年","summary":"阅读全文 → 缠绵整个六月的雨，直到七月初晴，不觉已是夏深。 妈妈开始买葡萄了。《论语》说不时不食，所以长辈们总是会挑时令的水果，刚吃过“五月脆李”，又迎来了铁山镇十里长廊又该挂满紫红的果串。筷子小手盘算着，横竖是周末，不如趁这还没热透，去看看那处比大足石刻宝顶山还老三百岁的石刻——尖山子摩崖石刻。 出门时太阳还没显出真本事，等车开到荣昌大足交界那一带，柏油路已经开始冒虚汗，远远看过去，路面上晃着一层水波似的光。之前来专程看过铁山镇的铁山老街不大，街上安安静静的，只有蝉在拼命地嘶叫，一声接一声，像是替这天气打广告。再往建角村走就找不到路了，问了屋里做活路的阿姨，三十多度的高温她还从房子里走出来，笑盈盈地给我指路。","url":"https://macin.org/2026/07/13/jian-shan-zi-shi-ke/","public_excerpt":true},{"id":290,"source_id":"qiaomu-0827","source_name":"Macin","category":"商业与行业观察","source_order":34,"published_at":"2026-07-20T15:17:17+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-26T08:05:13+00:00","first_seen_at":"2026-09-09T18:41:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T17:02:56+00:00","revision":9,"current_revision":9,"backfill":true,"content_kind":"summary","change_kind":"revised","change_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","change_label":"当日修订","revised_today":true,"revised_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","observed_revision":9,"publication_date_status":"known","snapshot_available":true,"content_observed_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","title":"当广东荔枝下市，四川合江的才刚红透","summary":"阅读全文 → 七月总算连晴了两周，终于可以出发去吃荔枝了。没见过太阳的水果，甜不到哪里去。 去年在合江尝过一次甜头（参看：合江县：超给“荔”的呀！），今年便早早惦记着，不止想买，还想去看看树上那一簇簇红果子究竟是什么模样，所以周末天刚亮，就带着这点甜念上路了。 进合江地界，路边先冒出来的是些小粒的龙眼和荔枝树。这本是岭南的珍果，不知什么因缘际会就来到了西南的山区里，闯进了这片本不属于它的丘陵扎下了根，年复一年地开花结果，于是就没人觉得它是外来的了。","url":"https://macin.org/2026/07/20/he-jiang-li-zhi-2/","public_excerpt":true},{"id":289,"source_id":"qiaomu-0827","source_name":"Macin","category":"商业与行业观察","source_order":34,"published_at":"2026-07-27T15:01:07+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-26T08:05:13+00:00","first_seen_at":"2026-09-09T18:41:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T17:02:56+00:00","revision":9,"current_revision":9,"backfill":true,"content_kind":"summary","change_kind":"revised","change_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","change_label":"当日修订","revised_today":true,"revised_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","observed_revision":9,"publication_date_status":"known","snapshot_available":true,"content_observed_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","title":"流杯池：合江县深山里的一行东洋刻痕","summary":"阅读全文 → 凤鸣镇的老街上，问”古驿道“在哪儿，是没人搭理你的。得改口问”老街”，才有人肯搭理。问完还没完，对方会反问一句，你是要找老街上哪户人家？我们一时语塞，后来才反应过来，该说”李老大“、”刘幺妹儿“这样的名字才对——在这里，地名从来不是拿来指路的，谁家住在哪一段，比这条路叫什么名字更要紧。 凤鸣驿道位于合江县凤鸣镇社区，沿东北西南走向，最早建于明代，清代、民国又续修过几回，如今看到的这条路，是清时留下的模样：青石条、青石板铺成，全长五百一十三米，最宽处八米，最窄处只有两米，走着走着就窄成了一条巷子，两侧的木结构铺面挨得极近，抬头几乎看不见天。","url":"https://macin.org/2026/07/27/he-jiang-gu-ji/","public_excerpt":true},{"id":288,"source_id":"qiaomu-0827","source_name":"Macin","category":"商业与行业观察","source_order":34,"published_at":"2026-08-11T21:36:45+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-26T08:05:13+00:00","first_seen_at":"2026-09-09T18:41:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T17:02:56+00:00","revision":9,"current_revision":9,"backfill":true,"content_kind":"summary","change_kind":"revised","change_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","change_label":"当日修订","revised_today":true,"revised_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","observed_revision":9,"publication_date_status":"known","snapshot_available":true,"content_observed_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","title":"梭罗碥石刻：不知缘由裂成两半","summary":"阅读全文 → 这周去了一趟（弗罗里）达州渠县。 车出渠县县城往报恩乡方向开，走到与汉阙分叉的路口，再往前走拐进乡道。路越走越细，两边是缓坡上的庄稼地，偶尔闪过几户人家。快到一段山垭口时，路边半人高的土坡上兀地立着一根灰扑扑的石柱，八棱形顶上蹲着个兽，风化得只剩个轮廓。一脚刹车踩下来，倒回去看。","url":"https://macin.org/2026/08/11/suo-luo-bian/","public_excerpt":true},{"id":287,"source_id":"qiaomu-0827","source_name":"Macin","category":"商业与行业观察","source_order":34,"published_at":"2026-08-17T23:37:38+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-26T08:05:13+00:00","first_seen_at":"2026-09-09T18:41:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T17:02:56+00:00","revision":9,"current_revision":9,"backfill":true,"content_kind":"summary","change_kind":"revised","change_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","change_label":"当日修订","revised_today":true,"revised_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","observed_revision":9,"publication_date_status":"known","snapshot_available":true,"content_observed_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","title":"李白写\"汉家陵阙\"时，那些早塌了，只剩这几座...","summary":"阅读全文 → 有些地方，是专门用来唤醒前世的。 我做的是「筷子小手」——一个专门挖掘小众古迹和冷门县城的号。而在写这个号之前，我还有另一重身份：半个穿越小说写手。 写穿越的人，都欠汉朝一次「穿越」 记得初中的时候，穿越小说正流行，我也算半个写手。那会儿《步步惊心》《梦回大清》风靡一时，我在一个作者QQ群里，晋江文学城的创作者不少，出名的也有几个，但我印象里，作者堆里大概没有比我更小的了。","url":"https://macin.org/2026/08/17/qu-xian-han-que/","public_excerpt":true},{"id":286,"source_id":"qiaomu-0827","source_name":"Macin","category":"商业与行业观察","source_order":34,"published_at":"2026-08-19T19:28:49+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-26T08:05:13+00:00","first_seen_at":"2026-09-09T18:41:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T17:02:56+00:00","revision":9,"current_revision":9,"backfill":true,"content_kind":"summary","change_kind":"revised","change_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","change_label":"当日修订","revised_today":true,"revised_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","observed_revision":9,"publication_date_status":"known","snapshot_available":true,"content_observed_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","title":"Cloudflare R2 图床在微信公众号排版时的踩坑","summary":"阅读全文 → 结论先行：R2 图床在公众号裂图的真凶，不是水印、不是跨境、也不是 Workers 的 CPU 上限，而是 Worker 冷启动 + 实时图片处理管线导致首请求超时。治本是「让公众号绕过 Worker，走 R2 原生直出」，同时用子域分流把水印保留给博客。本文复盘完整排查链路。 背景：为什么从 OSS 迁到 R2 我的博客图床原来用阿里云 OSS 存图。OSS 有个很香的特性——水印靠 URL 参数触发： 1 2 无水印：https://macinorg-blog.oss-cn-chengdu.aliyuncs.com/blog/xxx.webp 带水印：https://macinorg-blog.oss-cn-chengdu.aliyuncs.com/blog/xxx.webp?x-oss-process=style/wechat-mp 同一份源图，博客用带水印链接、公众号用无水印链接，体验很顺。","url":"https://macin.org/2026/08/19/r2-image-wechat/","public_excerpt":true},{"id":285,"source_id":"qiaomu-0827","source_name":"Macin","category":"商业与行业观察","source_order":34,"published_at":"2026-08-25T19:46:49+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-26T08:05:13+00:00","first_seen_at":"2026-09-09T18:41:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T17:02:56+00:00","revision":9,"current_revision":9,"backfill":true,"content_kind":"summary","change_kind":"revised","change_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","change_label":"当日修订","revised_today":true,"revised_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","observed_revision":9,"publication_date_status":"known","snapshot_available":true,"content_observed_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","title":"隆昌深山这座破宅，牵出一位被遗忘的辛亥革命元老","summary":"阅读全文 → 人这一生，说到底是选择的总和。可选择本身又是个悖论——年轻时不知道要什么，等知道了，能选的又不多了。多数人只是被日子推着走，走到哪算哪，像风里的一片瓦，落地才知道落在了哪户人家的檐下。可总有那么一些人，在历史的岔路口，把选择做成了惊心动魄的事。 这个周日原是排得满满的，要去看好几处地方。谁知颈源性偏头痛发作，坐车十分钟便要作呕，只好把计划收起来，权当就近溜达。人算不如天算，身体这东西，从来是最诚实的向导，它说不行，便当真不行。于是和小伙伴一起去了隆昌市界市镇叶家沟的黄家大院老屋。","url":"https://macin.org/2026/08/25/long-chang-huang-jia-da-yuan/","public_excerpt":true},{"id":284,"source_id":"qiaomu-0827","source_name":"Macin","category":"商业与行业观察","source_order":34,"published_at":"2026-09-01T21:53:38+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-26T08:05:13+00:00","first_seen_at":"2026-09-09T18:41:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T17:02:56+00:00","revision":9,"current_revision":9,"backfill":true,"content_kind":"summary","change_kind":"revised","change_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","change_label":"当日修订","revised_today":true,"revised_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","observed_revision":9,"publication_date_status":"known","snapshot_available":true,"content_observed_at":"2026-11-27T00:42:49+00:00","title":"曼远/曼掌/曼丢：佛是大家的，鬼是各家的","summary":"阅读全文 → 飞机降落嘎洒机场那一刻，舷窗外是成片的橡胶林和红土地，热浪裹着湿气扑进机舱。 第一站是曼景保村，就在机场边上。眼前这些底层架空、上层住人的竹楼，其实是一种极古老的建筑基因——干栏式建筑最早可追溯至浙江余姚的河姆渡文化，此后成为南方百越族群的居住传统，以竹木为主要建材，通常两层，下层堆放杂物、饲养牲畜，上层住人，如今在傣、壮、侗、黎等民族中仍能看到各自的变体。","url":"https://macin.org/2026/09/01/dai-zu-zhai-zi/","public_excerpt":true}],"article_count":20,"error":null},{"source_id":"qiaomu-0838","source_order":35,"catalog_sequence":838,"curated_order":null,"name":"Yubolun 博客","author":"yubolun","category":"商业与行业观察","description":"博主 yubolun 主理的独立博客，归入【商业与行业观察】，主要聚焦 编程、投资、加密货币 等主题的持续记录与实践探索。","subcategory":"投资与金融","status":"summary_only","last_checked":"2026-11-28T17:02:30+00:00","last_success":"2026-11-28T17:02:30+00:00","original_tags":"编程、投资、加密货币","homepage_url":"https://yub